// leaves Bitcoin. Ownership is proven by a BIP-322 signature over a canonical message,
// and every Bitcoin fact reaching these contracts is an EIP-712 attestation carrying at
// least 3 signatures from a 5-member verifier quorum. This is an ATTESTED settlement
// system, not a trustless bridge — the quorum is a trust assumption, and it is the
// single most important thing to review. See BitcoinOwnershipOracle first.
//
