//
//   1. BitcoinOwnershipOracle  — quorum verification, replay protection, digest consumption
//   2. HoodPupOfferEscrow      — the money path: offers, settlement, refunds
//   3. PayoutVault             — pull-payment accounting; refunds must survive a pause
//   4. RootOwnershipRegistry   — the one-root-one-pup invariant and ownership epochs
//
